<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Long time ago, the Whirl Islands was\none big island.\rTwo countries was beefin’ over it.\nLike two dudes over a parkin’ spot.\rLUGIA, the island’s guardian, got fed\nup, threw LIGHTNIN’, and ripped the\fisland into four pieces. Then it\fwent to the bottom of the waterfall\fto sulk.\rBring the Silver Wing and I’ll let you\nthrough.\rBut LUGIA only show up for people with\nREAL trust with their homies...\rNot clout chasers. LUGIA can smell it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LUGIA, the island’s homie, hid\nitself deep in the waterfall basin,\fand nobody seen it since...\rIf somebody who could bring back real\ntrust between people and homies\fcame through with somethin’ tied to\fLUGIA, it might show itself\ffor ’em...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That thing you got...!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found it...\nGo ’head.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found it...\nGo ’head.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Silver Wing just let you go\ndown the waterfall.\rIf you ain’t the kinda person who\nbring trust back between people\fand homies, LUGIA ain’t never gon’\fshow itself to you...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmmm.\rSo it was you and the Bell!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0124_D40R0104_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You a real one for your age...\nAt your age I was failin’ gym class.</language>
	</row>
</body>
